<h1>Techniques &amp; Materials</h1>
<p>My work combines traditional craftsmanship with contemporary processes. I use ancient techniques - carving wood with hand-tools and shaping leather over the surface - and modern tools - 3D design software and 3D printing. I bring the two together by scanning hand sculpted clay for my designs, and applying wax finishes derived from linseed oil, beeswax, and carnauba.</p>

<p>My design and manufacture aims at durability, responsiveness, and character to create a mask that feels alive when worn by a performer and observed by an audience.</p>


